 .../config-hip-clang-nvidia-platform.json        |  6 +++---
 .../generic-parallel/cuda-clang/test.check       | 13 +++++++++++++
 .../hip-clang-nvidia-platform/test.check         | 13 +++++++++++++
 .../generic-parallel/cuda-clang/test.check       |  2 +-
 .../hip-clang-nvidia-platform/test.check         |  2 +-
